!.env.example

# Local/generated artifacts
artifacts/
data/
runs/*

# Keep the small, reviewable selection outputs that are referenced by the
# factor-processing report.  Large matrices and market-data files stay local.
!runs/
!runs/factor_selection_v2_direction_review/
!runs/factor_selection_v2_direction_review/*.csv
!runs/factor_selection_v2_direction_review/*.json
!runs/factor_selection_v2_direction_review/*.md

# Derived market data and serialized panels
*.parquet
*.sqlite3
*.db
